+the user: "when i got out of VR mode, i noticed my psvr2 controllers did not WORK to
+play the game in 2d or 3d mode." Menus worked, gameplay did not, and that split is
+exactly the architecture: charter A10's SDL filter hands the spatial pair to the
+native backend, so SDL never sees it and `joy_active_controller` is NULL; VR drives
+it through VKQ_VR_ApplyHandInput, which only runs while a VR world frame is being
+built; and R5's VKQ_VR_UIInputPump covers menus, the console and modals — its gate
+is `modal || sheet || key_dest != key_game`, i.e. everything EXCEPT gameplay.
