+  - the response curves are IN_ApplyDeadzone (circular) and IN_ApplyEasing, with
+    joy_deadzone_move / joy_deadzone_look / joy_exponent* / joy_sensitivity_* —
+    the pad's curves, not the VR path's own quadratic vkq_vr_stick_axis;
+  - the binds are whatever K_* the pad's binds are, through
